{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascension</strong> is a roguelite where you're summoned to the land of gods and demons \u2014 a place where only legends dare to challenge the Tower of Worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2026 you\u2019re an unemployed loser with a pathetic life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gods and demons watch your every move in a live stream, commenting on your failures and triumphs.<br>Earn their interest to receive trades and sponsorships that might help you climb the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend to the top \u2014 but remember:<br>You\u2019re not the hero.<br>You\u2019re the content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTERACTIVE CHAT &amp; STREAM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gods and demons react to everything you do \u2014 live.<br>Receive proposals, sponsorships, and missions from the Constellations while the chat responds in real time to your hits, mistakes, and decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FUSION, EVOLUTION &amp; AWAKENING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities of different elements to create new forms of power.<br>Awaken stronger versions of each skill, unlock upgrades, and enhance your attributes.<br>Discover unique elemental fusions and build insane combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREE BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your build, your style \u2014 even your basic attack.<br>Discard, merge, or swap abilities whenever you want.<br>Total freedom.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661580?t=1761046505","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661580?t=1761046505","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/2991acc3925828f67fa6f5f1f2f2c6675653fce5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761046505","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/2991acc3925828f67fa6f5f1f2f2c6675653fce5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761046505","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascension</strong> is a roguelite where you're summoned to the land of gods and demons \u2014 a place where only legends dare to challenge the Tower of Worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2026 you\u2019re an unemployed loser with a pathetic life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gods and demons watch your every move in a live stream, commenting on your failures and triumphs.<br>Earn their interest to receive trades and sponsorships that might help you climb the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend to the top \u2014 but remember:<br>You\u2019re not the hero.<br>You\u2019re the content.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTERACTIVE CHAT &amp; STREAM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gods and demons react to everything you do \u2014 live.<br>Receive proposals, sponsorships, and missions from the Constellations while the chat responds in real time to your hits, mistakes, and decisions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FUSION, EVOLUTION &amp; AWAKENING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities of different elements to create new forms of power.<br>Awaken stronger versions of each skill, unlock upgrades, and enhance your attributes.<br>Discover unique elemental fusions and build insane combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREE BUILD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your build, your style \u2014 even your basic attack.<br>Discard, merge, or swap abilities whenever you want.<br>Total freedom.</p>","developers":["Required"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661580/5f4d996e8a81779a2ad1abd92d7c